MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Comprehensive rename of all remaining 'devonn' references in workflows:
- Service names, deployment targets, namespaces
- Docker image tags and ECR registry paths
- Artifact names and cache keys
- Metrics and observability identifiers
- Terraform resource groups and environment names
- Falco/eBPF rule references
- Correlation ID prefixes
- Renamed devonn-deploy.yml → d3vonn-deploy.yml

All 42 workflow files now consistently use the d3vonn brand.

Refs: #279
